# Device invite

- **v2 QR:** HTTPS app URL with `#i=TANDEM2.…` (AES-GCM blob) — **hash only**, never `?i=` (logs/Referer).
- **Pairing code:** 10-char Crockford alphabet; PBKDF2 300k for invite KDF. Shown next to QR only. Treat link alone as sensitive.
- Strip invite hash at **app bootstrap** (not only setup). Clear pending stash on lock / unused lock-ready path.
- Do **not** emit cleartext `TANDEM1.` / `tandem-device:` (legacy decode + double-confirm only). Never use a custom `scheme:` URI.
- Setup: open link / scan / paste → pairing code → `testGitHubConnection` → vault probe → master password. Abort paths must zero username/repo/PAT state.
- UI: don’t screenshot code with QR; hide when done; link is sensitive even without code.
- Do not put invite URLs, pairing codes, or PATs in logs, README examples, or commits.
